        "summary":  "NVIDIA released Cosmos 3, an open-source foundation model family for physical AI that enables robots, autonomous vehicles, and vision AI systems to understand and predict environment behavior. Released under the OpenMDW 1.1 license, Cosmos 3 ranks first across multiple physical-AI benchmarks and is designed to be fine-tuned for specific hardware and operational environments. NVIDIA\u0027s physical AI stack integrates Cosmos with Omniverse simulation tools and OpenUSD standards to streamline the full training-to-deployment workflow.",
